  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Christian Democracy and Labour after World War II (2023), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has no recorded citations, downloads or public discussion yet. This is an early record rather than a quiet one — the signals collected for it so far are thin.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Christian Democracy and Labour after World War II by Andrea Maria Locatelli and Cecilia Maria Bravi was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2023. It is part of the Travail et Société / Work and Society series. Conceptually, the work connects to Democracy, Political science, Civil society, Relation (database) and Social change.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 3 library collections. Its subject matter aligns with Decent work and economic growth among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
